sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend (FastAPI)
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini API

    %% Style the participants for clarity
    participant User as User
    participant FE as Frontend (Next.js)
    participant BE as Backend (FastAPI)
    participant Gemini as Google Gemini API

    alt Highlight-to-Explain
        User->>FE: 1. Highlights text on a page
        FE-->>User: 2. Shows "[Explain with AI]" popover
        User->>FE: 3. Clicks the button
    else Direct Chat
        User->>FE: 1. Opens chat & sends a question
    end

    FE->>BE: 4. POST /api/ai/chat (query, context)
    activate BE
    
    note right of BE: RAG Process Starts
    
    BE->>BE: 5. Retrieve relevant data from DB
    
    BE->>Gemini: 6. Generate explanation (prompt + data + query)
    activate Gemini
    Gemini-->>BE: 7. Return generated text
    deactivate Gemini
    
    note right of BE: RAG Process Ends
    
    BE-->>FE: 8. Send AI response to Frontend
    deactivate BE

    FE-->>User: 9. Display AI response in chat window